GOONJ TI HAI ZAINAB KI SADA KARBOBALA KE MAIDAN MEIN <br>
HOGAYA TANHA BHAI MERE KARBOBALA KE MAIDAN MEIN<br>
<br>
1. AOUN O MOHD LAAL MERE FAUJ E ADO SE AISE LAADE <br>
 YAAD AAYI BABA KI WEGA KARBOBALA KE MAIDAN MEIN<br>
<br>
2. HAA YE WO PYAARA NANHA GALA TEER E SITAM SE CHEDA GAYA <br>
 SAHMI ZAMEEN AUR ARSH HILAA KARBOBALA KE MAIDAN MEIN<br>
<br>
3. KEHTI HAI ROO KE ROOH E HASAN BEWAA HOVI EK SHAB KI DULHAN <br>
 MARAGAYA QASIM DULHA KARBOBALA KE MAIDAN MEIN<br>
<br>
4. SIBTE NABI KA NOOR E NAZAR THA JO SABIH E PAIGAMBAR <br>
 TUKDE KALEJA US KA HUWA KARBOBALA KE MAIDAN MEIN<br>
<br>
5. BHAI MERE ABBAS SE JAARI QUWATE QALBE SIBTEY NABI <br>
 NAHAR PE PYAASA MARA GAYA KARBOBALA KE MAIDAN MEIN<br>
<br>
6. UMMET NE BE JURM O QATA KATA MERE BHAI KA GALA <br>
 LAASH KO BHI PAMAAL KIYA KARBOBALA KE MAIDAN MEIN<br>
<br>
7. BOLI SAKINA ROO ROOKER CHEENE GAYA MERE GOUHAR <br>
 BAAD E PIDAR PURSA YEH MILA KARBOBALA KE MAIDAN MEIN<br>
<br>
8. KASIE BHALA ZAMIN HO BAYAN ZAINAB KI WOH AAH O FUGAA <br>
 AAYE THE JIS DAM SHER E KHUDA KARBOBALA KE MAIDAN MEIN<br>
